  "notes": [
    "Admission beyond 12k requires this independent seed to have later-minus-earlier pooled >0, >=2/3 anchors positive, Standard10 >=0, both seats >=0, positive worst reward alignment on >=75% of steps, exact resume/accounting/hashes, 12k greedy agreement >=95%, disagreement growth <=2 points, and cap <=0.25. Combined seed0+seed1 raw slopes will then be aggregated; CI need not exclude zero for seed1 alone.",
    "Raw seed1 evaluation SHA 83eb5543a5f5364a17fc246bf9b2a7382ec651d64679910c45100f5f0eb09010. Combining the two independent raw 8k-to-12k curves gave 6,144 pairs / 24,576 hands: pooled +12.341390 bb/100 CI[-1.155395,25.838175], anchors Standard10 +14.367676, Slumbot-free +5.696289, CFR96 +16.960205, seats +19.989583 and +4.693197."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "Seed1 exact continuation completed 4,096 new hands and retained positive reward alignment on 32/32 steps. Its 12k-minus-8k slope was pooled +2.924 bb/100 CI[-18.041,23.890], Standard10 +0.269, Slumbot-free -19.947, CFR96 +28.452, seat0 +24.791, seat1 -18.942. Agreement remained 97.27% and disagreement growth 1.204 points. Combined across both seeds, pooled and every anchor/seat point were positive, but CI crossed zero.",
    "conclusion": "The six-objective 8k-to-12k slope is positive in both seeds and positive across all combined anchors/seats, supporting an undertrained interpretation. However seed1 failed the preregistered single-seed Slumbot-free and seat1 breadth conditions. Therefore higher-dose scaling is held rather than rejected; additional evidence should prioritize proxy-to-external alignment or precision, not another optimizer tweak.",
    "decision": "HOLD_BEYOND_12K_ON_SEED1_SEAT_VARIANCE",
    "next_step": "Do not increase the training dose yet. Audit deployment compatibility for the strongest frozen 12k MGDA checkpoint and, if exact dual-contract execution can be evidenced, use a small fresh Slumbot directional gate to test whether the now-positive multi-seed internal learning curve aligns with the external target. Otherwise increase internal paired precision on the frozen 8k/12k curves."
